de_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T10:36:57Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T10:36:57Z","body":"Confirmed on `v4.5.beta.custom_build [71a994815]`, I think it is potentially subjective which behaviour makes more sense - should the dropdown menu be a consistent size so the options are always visible or should it match the zoom size of the other controls in the shader editor? I've still tagged this as a regression and a release blocker so it can be assessed properly ahead of the release\n\n```\nGodot v4.5.beta (71a994815) - macOS Sequoia (15.5.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 (Apple7) - Apple M1 (8 threads) - 16.00 GiB memory\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3096125782/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3096450592","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108609#issuecomment-3096450592","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108609","id":3096450592,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64kBYg","user":{"login":"Foyezes","id":106163842,"node_id":"U_kgDOBlPugg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106163842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Foyezes","html_url":"https://github.com/Foyezes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Foyezes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Foyezes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Foyezes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Foyezes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Foyezes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Foyezes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Foyezes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Foyezes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Foyezes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T12:00:53Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T12:01:45Z","body":"It definitely should be consistent.  If it matches the zoom level, it's way too large or too small. It should have a fixed size, but scale down to fit when the dropdown is way too large.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3096450592/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3096568800","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108609#issuecomment-3096568800","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108609","id":3096568800,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64kePg","user":{"login":"CreatedBySeb","id":11736217,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzM2MjE3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11736217?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb","html_url":"https://github.com/CreatedBySeb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/CreatedBySeb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-21T12:35:50Z","updated_at":"2025-07-21T12:35:50Z","body":"I think the argument for the other way around would be that the other UI elements (dropdown triggers themselves, text inputs, etc.) are that 'too large' or 'too small' size, so it potentially makes sense for all of the elements to be that size. We don't disallow the zoom because we think it makes those elements too large or too small, so does it make sense to disallow zoom on the dropdown selection specifically?\n\nI'm not sure which way makes more sense myself, but I could see how you could argue either behaviour is preferable, and so from one perspective this isn't a regression but a fix. Hoping others can also chime in with their thoughts and justifications.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3096568800/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3121555940","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108609#issuecomment-3121555940","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108609","id":3121555940,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc66Dynk","user":{"login":"gtibo","id":42919030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyOTE5MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42919030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo","html_url":"https://github.com/gtibo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gtibo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-26T09:19:40Z","updated_at":"2025-07-26T09:21:43Z","body":"These kind of issues are always subjective.\nAs someone who as hard time reading small text on screen I don't really zoom this much out anyway, maybe this could be an option (e.g: \"keep drop down text absolute size\" or something)\n\nSomething that I noticed is that the menu doesn't scale when zooming while active\n\nExample:\n<img width=\"1088\" height=\"599\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a322497d-1680-4445-b2f8-1f7a52a75682\" />\n\"Shoot! I clicked on the menu but the text is too small... let's zoom in\"\n\n<img width=\"1088\" height=\"599\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2b782dd3-68b4-4c1e-8bfb-1287d551373b\" />\n\":( it's still small\"\n\nIt's quite nitpicky, but I think it would help the UX if the popup scale was consistent too when zooming in or out (less clicking around).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3121555940/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3232069506","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108609#issuecomment-3232069506","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108609","id":3232069506,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ApXeC","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-28T06:20:28Z","updated_at":"2025-08-28T06:20:28Z","body":"The change in dropdown sizing is deliberate, but it was done to fix dropdowns in scaled UI, and graph editor might be a special case and need an exception.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3232069506/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]